title: The District Question
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and organisers_timer <= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.organisers_timer = 3;
Q.month_actions += 1;
// the least loyal district
var target = Q.districts[0];
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] < Q['district_' + target + '_loyalty']) {
        target = d;
    }
}
Q.target_district = target;
Q.target_district_name = Q.district_names[target];
Q.target_faction = Q['district_' + target + '_faction'];
Q.target_faction_name = Q.faction_names[Q.target_faction];
Q.target_is_rival = Q.target_faction != Q.leading_faction ? 1 : 0;
Q.target_flipped = 0;
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= The District Question

The district secretary in **[+ target_district_name +]** answers the Zentrale's letters late or not at all, and the district paper prints what it likes. [? if target_is_rival = 1 : The district follows the [+ target_faction_name +]. ?]

- @send: Send organisers from Berlin.
- @autonomy: Let the district run its own affairs.
- @replace: Remove the district leadership.
- @easy_discard

@send
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The district comes closer to the Zentrale, and may come over to our current.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
var d = Q.target_district;
Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] += 20;
if (Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] >= 80 && Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] != Q.leading_faction) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] = Q.leading_faction;
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] = 60;
    Q.target_flipped = 1;
}
!}

Three organisers rent rooms in [+ target_district_name +] and speak at every branch meeting. [? if target_flipped = 1 : By the autumn the district has come over to the [+ leading_faction_name +]. ?]

@autonomy
subtitle: The [+ target_faction_name +] are pleased and the party is calmer.
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.target_faction + '_satisfaction'] += 8;
Q.unity += 3;
!}

@replace
subtitle: The district changes sides at once, and loses many of its members.
choose-if: target_is_rival = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The district already follows our current.
on-arrival: {!
var d = Q.target_district;
Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] = Q.leading_faction;
Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] = 60;
Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.6;
Q[Q.target_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 20;
Q.unity -= 8;
!}

The Central Committee dissolves the district committee and appoints a new one. Many members follow their old leaders out of the party.
